{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0baecdf6-49dc-55f4-ae58-530c20694943", "source_ordinal": 975, "reading_ordinal": 3082, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "寒光", "published_at": "2025-02-03T08:36:01.773000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/3f439e12e1a411efae365254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这其实蛮简单的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "乘坐人对刹车的感应，其实来自于刹停的后效。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这个后效最关键的要害，就是刹车减速所导致的上身前倾效应强烈到了乘客上半身实际上已经几乎离开了靠背，不再受到靠背的支撑。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 90}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "一旦刹车进程结束，因为负加速度的消失，乘客的上半身就会有一个补偿性的后倒动作，重新“跌”回座椅靠背中。而这个跌回动作会导致后背和靠背、后脑与头靠的一次明显撞击。", "char_start": 91, "char_end": 171}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这时就“刹车有感”了。", "char_start": 172, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "而要改善这个体验，最有效的手段实际上并不是“如何刹车”，而是一个更简单的策略——引导乘客调整靠背，采用更倾向后躺的坐姿，但同时将座位前移，保持脚能自然的接触脚踏区域。", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 267}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "考虑地铁，你就会发现侧坐的乘客比没有抓握固定的站姿乘客对加减速不敏感得多。双手插兜站在地铁上的乘客，轻轻一加速减速就会站立不稳、踉踉跄跄。", "char_start": 268, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "同样道理，如果乘客的坐姿后背非常前倾，以至于完全竖直甚至整体前倾，那么你轻轻一刹车ta的整个上身都会有强烈的前倾感。如果你把座椅调得大幅后仰，ta的后背结结实实的压在靠背上，刹车负加速度即使到达相当强度，也不足以让整个上身完全脱离靠背漂浮起来，仍然会受到后背支撑，人就不会不自觉的调动任何肌肉来对抗前倾感，这就会形成“无感体验”。", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 503}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而为什么又要保持双足和前踏接触呢？因为只要自然接触，即使不收紧任何肌肉，仅靠放松的肌肉骨骼构造就足以在相当程度上顶住身体轻微的“前滑”倾向，会进一步的降低身体调动肌肉主动对抗减速感的本能。", "char_start": 504, "char_end": 598}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "后背越后仰，踏脚越切实，乘客的坐姿对刹车的感受就会越迟钝，无感减速的空间就越大，驾驶员的操作容错率就会越大。", "char_start": 599, "char_end": 653}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "基本上你注意好这两条，只要你不是太手残、车距保持不是太极端，基本上已经没问题了。", "char_start": 654, "char_end": 694}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "如果你要进一步的解决问题，确保这种体验良好，你可以做好这个细节——确保你自己的座椅靠背调得比乘客竖直，从而确保你自己的身体对减速的体感比乘客敏锐。", "char_start": 695, "char_end": 768}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "其实大部分被乘客抱怨的驾驶员，从根上讲就是自己的靠背比乘客躺得更平，以至于ta本人对减速的感受比乘客迟钝。自己感觉良好，乘客已经想吐了。", "char_start": 769, "char_end": 837}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这又引申出一项观察——注意看公交车的驾驶座就往往不会给出很大的后仰调整余地，并且安装位置比一般的乘客位更高，这样可以确保司机不会“过于舒适”，以至于错误判断乘客的感受。司机自己舒服，乘客一定更舒服。", "char_start": 838, "char_end": 937}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这也是担任礼宾车司机的职业素养之一——车一停稳，你打开车门一看司机位和乘客位预设的靠背角度差异，就知道这司机的接待水平如何。", "char_start": 938, "char_end": 1000}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "如果是真正的VIP接待，协调人在前期准备中看到这个细节不对，眼睛里都会寒光一闪——这家服务商缺少专业接待经验，可能别处要出问题。", "char_start": 1001, "char_end": 1065}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "例如检查车载冰箱里准备的冷饮，很可能温度没有提前冷却到位。车载空调可能没有清洗仔细，有司机自己难以觉察的轻微异味。", "char_start": 1066, "char_end": 1123}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "整个检查力度都会提升一级。", "char_start": 1124, "char_end": 1137}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0446"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎样刹车能稳到乘坐人无感？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“寒光”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这其实蛮简单的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这其实蛮简单的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "3a7b8b75-b3de-50b4-ac04-733128e9efcb", "source_ordinal": 974, "reading_ordinal": 3083, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "有理由退货", "published_at": "2025-02-03T16:53:44.219000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/400151350/answer/91720042302"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "请她折价挂闲鱼，我拍下来她发货。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "但如果质量存在问题，将会请闲鱼平台的客服仲裁。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 40}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0446"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：同事说她在淘宝买的衣服，过了7天无理由退换货，吊牌也剪掉了，但是她不喜欢要退货，如果你是商家怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002"], "summary": "围绕“有理由退货”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“请她折价挂闲鱼，我拍下来她发货。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "请她折价挂闲鱼，我拍下来她发货。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "06dce082-a942-5c6b-b390-9a9486785b07", "source_ordinal": 973, "reading_ordinal": 3084, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "千万别抬头", "published_at": "2025-02-04T12:53:42.327000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/594350477/answer/92509772558"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "如果以财务自由——这是指纯依靠资产性收入（例如租金、分红、利息）即可满足自己的生存需求——作为成功的指标，那么：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "已知改革开放之前中国几乎没有富人。", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 74}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "已知现在中国有大量的富人。", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "显然可知目前的富人绝大多数都是穷人的孩子。", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 110}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "有人可能要争辩“这是在没有富人的前提下才可行”。", "char_start": 111, "char_end": 135}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但这显然忽视了改革开放已有四十年，这已经是真正两三代人的跨度，而很显然现在的富人数量要比二十年前多。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "起码多个几百万甚至几千万——取决于你如何定义“生存需求”。", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "有人可能又要争辩——我说的不是财务自由，我说的是登峰造极的那种成功。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "那么中国两院院士足够说明问题了吧？", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "新中国出生院士群体的成长特点、人格特征与影响因素 On the Growth Characteristics, Personality and Influencing Factors of Academicians Born in New China", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "从广东籍两院院士的家庭成长背景调查看学霸的诞生", "char_start": 397, "char_end": 420}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所以，至少目前的事实很显然的不支持“穷人的孩子成功不了”这种结论。", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "它显然到这样一种地步，只要你抬头看，就能看到这是胡扯淡。", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "一抬头就会看穿，意味着这是一种需要“千万别抬头”才能维护的信仰。", "char_start": 484, "char_end": 516}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "头顶上现放着一个太阳，自己晒的冒汗、地上都是影子，但要咬紧牙关一辈子不抬头，坚定的相信“这个世界上没有太阳”，这是一种什么样的精神？", "char_start": 517, "char_end": 583}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这是一种虔诚。", "char_start": 584, "char_end": 591}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "虔诚一定是有精神回报才能自我维持的。", "char_start": 592, "char_end": 610}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "换言之，相信“穷人的孩子成功不了”有丰富的回报，以至于很多人宁可付出一辈子不抬头看的代价也要维护起来。", "char_start": 611, "char_end": 662}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "是什么回报？", "char_start": 663, "char_end": 669}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你要么清楚这是什么回报，那么你就是一个选择了这个回报而自愿主动放弃追求成功的人，你就别抱怨你“无法成功”了——因为你是拿了好处自己卖掉的，这是你自己选择的交易，你难道想吃了西瓜不给钱？", "char_start": 670, "char_end": 762}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你要么不清楚这有什么回报，纯属稀里糊涂跟着拿香拜——这就是纯糊涂蛋了。那就自己看看上面的证据，早点停止扯淡。", "char_start": 763, "char_end": 817}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "所以，到底是什么回报这么珍贵，以至于你要选一辈子不抬头？", "char_start": 818, "char_end": 846}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0446"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么穷人孩子成功不了？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“千万别抬头”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“如果以财务自由——这是指纯依靠资产性收入（例如租金、分红、利息）即可满足自己的生存需求——作为成功的指标，那么：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "如果以财务自由——这是指纯依靠资产性收入（例如租金、分红、利息）即可满足自己的生存需求——作为成功的指标，那么：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 56, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "3ba11ab8-7fee-5c01-adbd-724de6ba78eb", "source_ordinal": 972, "reading_ordinal": 3085, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "异人", "published_at": "2025-02-06T00:38:30.941000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/439054680/answer/93709251337"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "很简单啊，就是一直得一百分就行了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "所有科目都一百分，不就永远保持优势、不用考虑赶超问题了？", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果没得到一百分，那就把没得到一百分的作业、卷子搞明白到能得一百分为止。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "除了作文之外，一切有确定答案的问题，尤其是小学、初中阶段的问题，是没有理由自我安慰“没必要全对”的。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "第一遍没做对，可以理解、可以原谅。甚至第二次做还不对，也可以理解，但是第三次还不对，那就是自己在放任自己无知了。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "“大纲范围内有做过的题做不对”应该视为一种耻辱，只要这个问题存在，就有必要取消一切休假和娱乐，直到问题解决再说。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 248}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "什么“及格”“优秀”？满分才是标准。", "char_start": 249, "char_end": 267}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "扣分是在满分的基础上略有失误的结果，这才是正确的学习态度。而不是什么“已经及格了，不容易了”。", "char_start": 268, "char_end": 315}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "一直“满分不慎丢几分”，你就用不着“保持优势”，用不着“拉开差距”。", "char_start": 316, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "第二名是多少分有什么重要？我只关心我为什么不是满分。", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 377}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "我也不关心满分扣了几分是第几名，我只关心为什么会扣这几分。", "char_start": 378, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "什么“保持优势”？我根本没有劣势。", "char_start": 408, "char_end": 425}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "什么拉开距离？我头顶上根本没有可以被拉开的距离。", "char_start": 426, "char_end": 450}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "保持这个“金刚不坏之身”，本身就是世界上最好玩的游戏。", "char_start": 451, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "玩完了，我才会对别的游戏感兴趣。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 495}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这个游戏玩得如丧家之犬，拿别的游戏麻醉自己的颓败，此非勇者所为，智者所取。", "char_start": 496, "char_end": 533}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "什么普通人？", "char_start": 534, "char_end": 540}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "朕乃天降异人。", "char_start": 541, "char_end": 548}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0446"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：小学一年级的成绩都很好，如何学习才能在以后的学习中保持优势或是进行赶超？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“异人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“很简单啊，就是一直得一百分就行了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "很简单啊，就是一直得一百分就行了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8b701797-245f-5af1-930a-c3867f59f2c1", "source_ordinal": 971, "reading_ordinal": 3086, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "混沌", "published_at": "2025-02-06T02:40:56.546000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/11067457870/answer/93743101217"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么叫“你的文笔”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你写个框架，让deepseek往死里撰稿，你要它改，改到你满意为止。", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "此时的成品是谁的文笔？是你的文笔，还是deepseek的文笔？", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "当然是你的文笔。", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "真正的问题根本不是谁在执笔，而是谁对文字负责、谁说了算。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你真正的问题根本不是deepseek，而是你对文字的敏感性不够高，觉得这也挺好，那也挺好，看不出文字的毛病、看不出哪里丑恶无聊。", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "要当厨师，先要知道什么好吃什么不好吃；要当画家，先要知道什么美妙什么丑陋；要写东西，先要知道什么优美什么苍白。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你可以自己“写不出来”，但你一定要能看得出来。", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 260}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "懂画的人总能发现画面有无限修改的余地，世上根本没有“画完了”的画。", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 294}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "懂文字的人去看deepseek的所谓“文笔”，其实还远远谈不上及格，只是看上去腔调十足的花架子罢了。", "char_start": 295, "char_end": 345}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "雄奇险峻，瑰丽诡秘，深奥幽玄，人类自己尚未及于万一，何况汲汲于流俗的大语言模型乎？", "char_start": 346, "char_end": 387}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "如果你觉得大语言模型的语言能力“难以企及”，真正的原因是你自己还没有尽到一个人对文明的责任。其要害还不在于“文学”“艺术”这些形而上的方面，而是你连说清楚事件经过、阐述事故责任、主张功劳归属、开释用户疑虑这些要命的事都干不好也不干，恭喜、劝谏、通知，警告……等等这些生活不可或缺的技能独立放任不练。", "char_start": 388, "char_end": 537}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "自诩为“内向”“i人”“大老粗”，把这些处理得不好要赔钱甚至要坐牢的活动一概逃避、糊弄、推卸给父母家人承担。", "char_start": 538, "char_end": 592}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这根本不是文学问题，不是“我又不写小说，没必要追求文笔”的问题，而是生存问题，是作为一个功能健全、可以有效参与社会运作的社会成员的生活责任问题。", "char_start": 593, "char_end": 665}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "只要你扎扎实实的承担了、担起了这些责任，你就不会对deepseek、chatgpt这类语言模型平庸甚至简陋的“文笔”感到什么焦虑和震惊。", "char_start": 666, "char_end": 734}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因为它们差得还很远，远到如果它们写的东西未经你修改监管直接以你的名义被转发给客户、同事、读者，你会焦虑到恐慌的程度。", "char_start": 735, "char_end": 793}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "因为漏洞百出，品位浅薄，会砸招牌、捅娄子，明白吗？", "char_start": 794, "char_end": 819}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "为什么有了大模型你还是要学语文？", "char_start": 820, "char_end": 836}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "因为你的语文学不到能鄙视大模型的程度，不是你能不能写小说的问题，而是你生活不能自理，要吃一辈子哑巴亏、倒一辈子莫名其妙的楣的问题——是你找不到爱情、留不住朋友、说不服爹妈，总是跟错人、总是上大当、总是缩回地下室当乌龟的问题。", "char_start": 837, "char_end": 949}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你有胆试试用“我又不用写小说，我没必要学什么语文”来糊弄下试试，过个二十年，你回首前半生，不管你这时候已经看上去有多成功，你都会深刻的意识到低下的文字能力、理解能力、表达能力造成了多么昂贵的损失——很多是终身恨事、无价之憾。", "char_start": 950, "char_end": 1062}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "反而是你一事无成，浑浑噩噩，自诩“比上不足比下有余”，仍然词汇贫乏概念模糊，你才得不到这个正确的结论。", "char_start": 1063, "char_end": 1114}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "那样你是不会有“我的理解和表达能力害我至深”的痛苦，但是你会有一种“一切都莫名其妙，所有人都是骗子，没有任何东西可靠，所有的道德和理想都是骗局、所有的计划都是空想”的“虚无主义”。", "char_start": 1115, "char_end": 1205}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "实际上那哪里是“虚无主义”？", "char_start": 1206, "char_end": 1220}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "那是因为缺少概念界定能力、进而缺少任何有效的诊断、判定能力造成的混沌状态。", "char_start": 1221, "char_end": 1258}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "一片混沌，不但云深不知处，甚至不知身在何山中。", "char_start": 1259, "char_end": 1282}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "横看成岭，侧看还tm成岭。", "char_start": 1283, "char_end": 1296}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "不知其然，不知其所以然，甚至不知所云、不知所谓。", "char_start": 1297, "char_end": 1321}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "整个人生都处在一个自己说不清道不明、也不知道要往何处去的连呼救都不知道呼什么救的状态。", "char_start": 1322, "char_end": 1365}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你学到能说清楚你现在确切在痛苦什么的状态，你的“文笔”就已经必定在大模型之上。", "char_start": 1366, "char_end": 1405}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "如果你现在就觉得这种水平“一生难以企及”——这么说吧，你的“一生”其实还没开始。", "char_start": 1406, "char_end": 1446}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 30}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0446"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：发现我一生难以触及的文笔 DeepSeek 十几秒就可以生成上千字，感觉努力提升文笔没有意义，怎么办?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030"], "summary": "围绕“混沌”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么叫“你的文笔”？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么叫“你的文笔”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ae80551a-0df8-5462-a596-c81c43a8504c", "source_ordinal": 970, "reading_ordinal": 3087, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "混沌文笔", "published_at": "2025-02-06T11:03:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/11067457870/answer/93743101217"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么叫“你的文笔”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你写个框架，让deepseek往死里撰稿，你要它改，改到你满意为止。", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "此时的成品是谁的文笔？是你的文笔，还是deepseek的文笔？", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "当然是你的文笔。", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "真正的问题根本不是谁在执笔，而是谁对文字负责、谁说了算。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你真正的问题根本不是deepseek，而是你对文字的敏感性不够高，觉得这也挺好，那也挺好，看不出文字的毛病、看不出哪里丑恶无聊。", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "要当厨师，先要知道什么好吃什么不好吃；要当画家，先要知道什么美妙什么丑陋；要写东西，先要知道什么优美什么苍白。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你可以自己“写不出来”，但你一定要能看得出来。", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 260}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "懂画的人总能发现画面有无限修改的余地，世上根本没有“画完了”的画。", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 294}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "懂文字的人去看deepseek的所谓“文笔”，其实还远远谈不上及格，只是看上去腔调十足的花架子罢了。", "char_start": 295, "char_end": 345}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "雄奇险峻，瑰丽诡秘，深奥幽玄，人类自己尚未及于万一，何况汲汲于流俗的大语言模型乎？", "char_start": 346, "char_end": 387}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "如果你觉得大语言模型的语言能力“难以企及”，真正的原因是你自己还没有尽到一个人对文明的责任。其要害还不在于“文学”“艺术”这些形而上的方面，而是你连说清楚事件经过、阐述事故责任、主张功劳归属、开释用户疑虑这些要命的事都干不好也不干，恭喜、劝谏、通知，警告等等这些生活不可或缺的技能都放任不练。", "char_start": 388, "char_end": 534}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "自诩为“内向”“i人”“大老粗”，把这些处理得不好要赔钱甚至要坐牢的活动一概都逃避、糊弄、推卸给父母家人承担。", "char_start": 535, "char_end": 590}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这根本不是文学问题，不是“我又不写小说，没必要追求文笔”的问题，而是生存问题，是作为一个功能健全、可以有效参与社会运作的社会成员的生活责任问题。", "char_start": 591, "char_end": 663}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "只要你扎扎实实的承担了、担起了这些责任，你就不会对deepseek、chatgpt这类语言模型平庸甚至简陋的“文笔”感到什么焦虑和震惊。", "char_start": 664, "char_end": 732}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因为它们差得还很远，远到它们写的东西如果未经你修改、监管直接以你的名义被转发给客户、同事、读者，你会焦虑到恐慌的程度。", "char_start": 733, "char_end": 792}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "因为漏洞百出，品位浅薄，会砸招牌、捅娄子，明白吗？", "char_start": 793, "char_end": 818}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "为什么有了大模型你还是要学语文？", "char_start": 819, "char_end": 835}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "因为你的语文学不到能鄙视大模型的程度，不是你能不能写小说的问题，而是你生活不能自理，要吃一辈子哑巴亏、倒一辈子莫名其妙的楣的问题——是你找不到爱情、留不住朋友、说不服爹妈，总是跟错人、总是上大当、总是缩回地下室当乌龟的问题。", "char_start": 836, "char_end": 948}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你有胆用“我又不用写小说，我没必要学什么语文”来糊弄下试试，过个二十年，你回首前半生，不管你这时候已经看上去有多成功，你都会深刻地意识到低下的文字能力、理解能力、表达能力造成了多么昂贵的损失——很多是终身恨事，无价之憾。", "char_start": 949, "char_end": 1059}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "反而是你一事无成，浑浑噩噩，自诩“比上不足比下有余”，仍然词汇贫乏概念模糊，你才得不到这个正确的结论。", "char_start": 1060, "char_end": 1111}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "那样你是不会有“我的理解和表达能力害我至深”的痛苦，但是你会有一种“一切都莫名其妙，所有人都是骗子，没有任何东西可靠，所有的道德和理想都是骗局、所有的计划都是空想”的“虚无主义”。", "char_start": 1112, "char_end": 1202}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "实际上那哪里是“虚无主义”？", "char_start": 1203, "char_end": 1217}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "那是因为缺少概念界定能力、进而缺少任何有效的诊断、判定能力造成的混沌状态。", "char_start": 1218, "char_end": 1255}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "一片混沌，不但云深不知处，甚至不知身在何山中。", "char_start": 1256, "char_end": 1279}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "横看成岭，侧看还tm成岭。", "char_start": 1280, "char_end": 1293}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "不知其然，不知其所以然，甚至不知所云、不知所谓。", "char_start": 1294, "char_end": 1318}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "整个人生都处在一个自己说不清道不明、也不知道要往何处去的连呼救都不知道呼什么救的状态。", "char_start": 1319, "char_end": 1362}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你学到能说清楚你现在确切在痛苦什么的水平，你的“文笔”就已经必定在大模型之上。", "char_start": 1363, "char_end": 1402}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "如果你现在就觉得这种水平“一生难以企及”——这么说吧，你的“一生”其实还没开始。", "char_start": 1403, "char_end": 1443}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 30}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0446"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：发现我一生难以触及的文笔 DeepSeek 十几秒就可以生成上千字，感觉努力提升文笔没有意义，怎么办?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030"], "summary": "围绕“混沌文笔”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么叫“你的文笔”？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么叫“你的文笔”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ad7968f0-31b3-5b2d-b756-b9a3bf40308c", "source_ordinal": 969, "reading_ordinal": 3088, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "三重冠", "published_at": "2025-02-07T05:17:12.901000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/389058916/answer/94580863818"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "从一般观众视角的观赏性而言，中国的动画片已经上得了擂台，可以掰掰手腕了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "西方动画片在技术上的确要先进很多，但是我们的动画界非常善于扬长避短。毕竟电影的主要观赏性在于剧情、表演和镜头语言而不是全局光能传递、焦散、次表面散射、流体模拟、布料模拟……等等这些技术细节。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 132}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这些细节的确可以提升感受，但那是九秒七五和九秒八之间的差别——从破世界纪录的角度上讲，这零点零五秒犹如鸿沟天堑，职业选手看到这么大幅的领先纪录会激动得从椅子里跳起来，简直不敢相信自己竟能活着看到人把这个纪录再提升这么多。", "char_start": 133, "char_end": 243}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但是对一般观众，这就是一臂之差，细微到难以注意。", "char_start": 244, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "论电影本身，虽然中国商业动画仍然稚嫩，但和好莱坞相比并不是数量级的代差，比起很多政治正确入脑的荒唐作品甚至还有胜出。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 327}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但是如果谈论艺术动画、先锋动画，那我们的差距还非常巨大。", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 356}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "举点例子：", "char_start": 357, "char_end": 362}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "quote", "index": 8, "text": "【定格动画/1080P/英字】这绝妙的蛋糕！ Ce magnifique gâteau! (2018)https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Pg4y1a7vY", "char_start": 363, "char_end": 457}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这部片子的剧情、叙事手法这些东西放在一边，只说它对毛绒材料的运用，堪称登峰造极，匪夷所思。", "char_start": 458, "char_end": 503}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "quote", "index": 10, "text": "【中英字幕】满屏修复《老人与海》质感惊艳全网，俄罗斯导演油画动画长片 1080P The Old Man and the Seahttps://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1rA41117rS", "char_start": 504, "char_end": 611}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "quote", "index": 11, "text": "[合集][720P]怪化猫[1-12+前传9-11全]https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ex411F7nq/", "char_start": 612, "char_end": 683}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "在这方面，我们差距还很远。", "char_start": 684, "char_end": 697}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "争夺超大预算的奇观类商业电影的阵地只是万里长征第一步而已，要从文化上实实在在的和西方分庭抗礼，在先锋艺术领域还需要大量的英勇的探索。", "char_start": 698, "char_end": 764}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "别看这些二十几分钟的小短片，反而是这些看上去“都不知道有没有人会看”的勇气惊人的小东西，才是最难攻克的山巅堡垒。", "char_start": 765, "char_end": 821}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "大型商业片如黄金，先锋艺术、实验性短片如珠宝。两者镶嵌在一起才是完整的王冠。", "char_start": 822, "char_end": 860}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "没有这些珠宝，仅仅只有分量十足的黄金是不够的。黄金虽贵，多钱可得，但580克拉的天然钻石必须依赖天赐和运气。", "char_start": 861, "char_end": 915}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "而能有效发起、支撑和维护这种近乎献祭一般的艺术探索，本身就是一种“霸权”的表现。对这一点，全球的文化精英非常的敏感和信从。", "char_start": 916, "char_end": 977}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "放眼当今世界，我们和美西方在一般大众直观感受强烈的领域就算不是领先一头，至少也是势均力敌，但之所以美西方仍然能凝聚强大的信心，很大程度上就在于在这类严肃的、先锋的艺术领域西方的统治地位还没有受到实质性的挑战。", "char_start": 978, "char_end": 1082}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "连陈丹青这个境界都可以被看成排得上号的艺术家，还被主流媒体当成艺术“泰斗”去操持话语权，我们的文艺任务之艰巨，可想而知。", "char_start": 1083, "char_end": 1143}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "不要以为艺术只是“弄臣淫巧”，真正最顶端、最前线、最边界的思想、认知的竞争，和艺术有血脉相连、无可分割的关联。", "char_start": 1144, "char_end": 1199}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "说白一点——开拓新天地的工作，本质上就是一种艺术创作。", "char_start": 1200, "char_end": 1227}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "寻找新的理论、豪赌从未有人走过的道路，和尝试挑战从未有人设想的作品本质上是同一件事。", "char_start": 1228, "char_end": 1270}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "我们的科学家、哲学家、思想家如果同时不是能窥见堂奥的艺术家，世界人民，尤其是实际掌握着关键决定权的精英阶层，是无法对我们寄予足够坚决的信心的。", "char_start": 1271, "char_end": 1342}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "即使我们做出同样的芯片、拍出差不多的大片、做出毫不逊色的游戏甚至开发出领先一头的AI也一样，不在艺术的最前沿硬碰硬的、不打折扣的分庭抗礼、压美西方一头，世界精英阶层仍然会下注赌“下一次重大突破发生在美西方的概率更大”。", "char_start": 1343, "char_end": 1452}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "我们将长期停留在“广受尊重与爱戴”“举足轻重”“不可轻忽”，但达到不了万邦诚服、德被天下的主导性地位。", "char_start": 1453, "char_end": 1504}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "尽管前者已经足以称为民族复兴，但我们如果不主导人类文明，耐天下苍生何？", "char_start": 1505, "char_end": 1540}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "工业的课、技术的课、基建的课、经济的课，我们都补了，甚至已经超了。", "char_start": 1541, "char_end": 1574}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "伦理的课、思想的课、艺术的课，必须赶上。", "char_start": 1575, "char_end": 1595}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你们这代人要努力。", "char_start": 1596, "char_end": 1605}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26, "quote": 3}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0446"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：《哪吒》《大圣归来》在技术上是否已达到美国迪士尼梦工厂水平？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“三重冠”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“从一般观众视角的观赏性而言，中国的动画片已经上得了擂台，可以掰掰手腕了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "从一般观众视角的观赏性而言，中国的动画片已经上得了擂台，可以掰掰手腕了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2bf341d3-9ee6-53eb-87a7-369a7f59ec70", "source_ordinal": 968, "reading_ordinal": 3089, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "趣", "published_at": "2025-02-07T06:49:11.214000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/8253f5d4e4d411ef80a652540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "无趣的本质是懦弱，是对别人对自己投注兴趣的恐惧。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "有趣的话，谁都能想到几句，区别不在于你想不想得到，而在于你对这几句话释放出去的后果的直觉判断。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你害怕有哪点没演好沦为笑柄，你恐惧冷场，你恐惧抢了谁的风头结怨，你害怕失了矜持体面受人轻视，你害怕演好了遭人嫉妒，你害怕有人喊再来一个，你害怕观众抢白刨活，你害怕证明自己还不如你所轻视嗤笑的“小丑”们。", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你觉得观众的快乐不如这些可能的后果重要。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你觉得观众不如你重要。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "甚至，你根本没有考虑观众。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你知道有趣的人怎么想吗？", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 234}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "ta只想到这么好玩的东西，怎么能不让大家看到。", "char_start": 235, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "ta根本没在想演砸了怎么办，有人看不起怎么办，有人嫉妒怎么办，冷场怎么办。", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 296}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "还没来得及想这些，甚至就没想过这些，ta只有一个念头“这么好的梗，不说出来我会死”。", "char_start": 297, "char_end": 339}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "在那一瞬间，有趣的人是无我的，ta的眼里只有别人的快乐。", "char_start": 340, "char_end": 368}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这是因为头脑简单也罢、是因为性格冲动也罢、是因为涉世未深也罢，总而言之，就像初生牛犊不怕虎，这牛犊毕竟是昂然直对猛虎，毫无惧色。", "char_start": 369, "char_end": 433}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "甚至毫无惧意、毫无惧念。", "char_start": 434, "char_end": 446}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "“为了我的快乐，ta什么都没想，什么都不怕。”", "char_start": 447, "char_end": 470}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这才是使得一个人在观众眼里变得有趣的根源。", "char_start": 471, "char_end": 492}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "观众是观众，观众不是演员，正是因为观众自己也深深的害怕，自己就熟知这扼住歌喉、扭住舞姿的恐惧，所以观众无意识的就敬重这份置荣辱于度外、完全注目在对方的快乐上的英勇。", "char_start": 493, "char_end": 575}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "而且你注目的是我的快乐。", "char_start": 576, "char_end": 588}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "为了我的快乐，你敢于无视我自己不敢直视的无限险恶，竟毫无惧色，全然抛诸脑后。", "char_start": 589, "char_end": 627}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你笨拙又如何？你失误又怎样？你是为了我。", "char_start": 628, "char_end": 648}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "我怎么能不觉得你有趣？", "char_start": 649, "char_end": 660}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "我怎么能容你受辱？", "char_start": 661, "char_end": 670}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "我何忍让你受伤、沮丧、失望？", "char_start": 671, "char_end": 685}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这就是有趣的魔法，它不需要人在大脑里明确的意识到上面这全部的过程，甚至不需要人知道这些概念。", "char_start": 687, "char_end": 733}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "在小孩子一个字都不认识，甚至连“爸爸”“妈妈”都不会叫、只会看鬼脸的时候，人对这种应用的感受能力和回应本能已经生效了。", "char_start": 734, "char_end": 793}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "所以婴儿已经知道扮鬼脸的父母亲友们“有趣”。", "char_start": 794, "char_end": 816}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "而恰恰是同一原因，那些不是为了观众的快乐而是为了自己的虚荣和炫耀的“表演”，虽然技术精湛，场面宏大，却常常“莫名其妙”的变成灾难。", "char_start": 817, "char_end": 882}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "否则人们对表演的恐惧又是从哪里见识来的呢？", "char_start": 883, "char_end": 904}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "有趣的根源是爱。", "char_start": 905, "char_end": 913}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "爱你的观众，胜过你的尊荣。", "char_start": 914, "char_end": 927}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "爱ta的快乐，胜过你的生命。", "char_start": 928, "char_end": 942}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "忘记自己，只向着“好想看到你的笑容”奔跑，你就无论如何都是有趣的了。", "char_start": 943, "char_end": 977}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "不用任何技艺，砸锅砸得稀巴烂，出乖露丑也无妨。", "char_start": 978, "char_end": 1001}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "赴汤蹈火，博卿一笑。", "char_start": 1002, "char_end": 1012}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 34}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0446"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：无趣的本质是什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033"], "summary": "围绕“趣”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“无趣的本质是懦弱，是对别人对自己投注兴趣的恐惧。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "无趣的本质是懦弱，是对别人对自己投注兴趣的恐惧。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
